  ("Suleiman the Magnificent","Ottomans win at Mohács","Suleiman's army destroyed the Hungarian army and killed its king, opening Central Europe."),
  ("Ottomans win at Mohács","Ottoman siege of Vienna","With Hungary broken, the Habsburg capital was the next target."),
  ("Suleiman the Magnificent","Battle of Lepanto","Ottoman sea power, built up under Suleiman, dominated the Mediterranean until a Spanish-led Holy League fleet destroyed it at Lepanto. It was rebuilt within a year."),
