  ("Portugal takes Goa","Portugal takes Malacca","From Goa, Portugal seized the strait between the Indian Ocean and the South China Sea."),
  ("Portugal takes Malacca","Portuguese guns reach Japan","Malacca opened the route to China and Japan; Portuguese traders reached Tanegashima in 1543."),
  ("Portuguese guns reach Japan","Hideyoshi unifies Japan","Firearms, soon mass-produced in Japan, helped the warlords who ended Japan's century of civil war."),
  ("Dutch VOC founded","Japan closes to the West","Japan expelled the Catholic Portuguese but kept trading with the Protestant Dutch, who did not try to convert anyone."),
  ("Dutch VOC founded","Dutch found Cape Town","The VOC needed a halfway station on the long voyage to Asia, where its ships could take on fresh water and food."),
