  ("Mayflower lands at Plymouth","Massachusetts Bay Colony","Plymouth's survival encouraged a much larger Puritan migration, about 20,000 people in the 1630s."),
  ("Massachusetts Bay Colony","King Philip's War","Puritan expansion onto Wampanoag and Narragansett land led to war in 1675."),
  ("French found Quebec","French & Indian War begins","French and British colonies collided over the Ohio Valley, where a young George Washington fired the first shots."),
  ("French & Indian War begins","Seven Years' War","Fighting in the Ohio Valley merged into a global war between Britain and France in 1756."),
  ("Seven Years' War","Treaty of Paris: Britain wins Canada","Britain's global victory was settled in this treaty, which gave it Canada and Florida."),
  ("Treaty of Paris: Britain wins Canada","Stamp Act","Britain's national debt had nearly doubled during the war, and it decided the colonies should help pay for their own defence."),
